        <!-- ===================== Notes ===================== -->
        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="rounded=0;fillColor=#FFF5F5;strokeColor=#DD344C;html=1;fontSize=13;fontColor=#232F3E;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=10;" value="&lt;b&gt;northstar-dev-DataEngineer&lt;/b&gt; (new) — Trust: glue, lambda, sagemaker (sagemaker is required by CreateFeatureGroup)&lt;br&gt;• Glue: full access + glue:GetConnection · EC2: ENI create/delete/describe + CreateTags/DeleteTags on network-interface/*&lt;br&gt;• S3: read/write raw/, processed/, features/ (+ s3:GetBucketAcl, s3:PutObjectAcl for the offline store) · read only artifacts/glue/&lt;br&gt;• Feature Store: PutRecord, CreateFeatureGroup, DescribeFeatureGroup · CloudWatch Logs: write&lt;br&gt;• Denied by omission: cannot write artifacts/, cannot run SageMaker training jobs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;northstar-dev-MLEngineer&lt;/b&gt; (Lab 1, unchanged) — Trust: sagemaker&lt;br&gt;• SageMaker: training, endpoints, MLflow, model registry, Studio self-service · Feature Store: read&lt;br&gt;• S3: read/write features/ and artifacts/ · ECR: pull images · CloudWatch Logs: write · cannot write raw/ or processed/&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;northstar-dev-ModelMonitor&lt;/b&gt; (new) — Trust: sagemaker — &lt;i&gt;observes, does not act&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br&gt;• CloudWatch: PutMetricData, GetMetricStatistics, PutMetricAlarm, DescribeAlarms · Logs: write&lt;br&gt;• SageMaker: ListProcessingJobs, DescribeProcessingJob · S3: read only artifacts/&lt;br&gt;• Denied by omission: cannot invoke endpoints, write S3, modify models, or start processing jobs&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Lab 2 changes: private subnet + NAT gateway (Domain moved there, VpcOnly); DataEngineer and ModelMonitor roles; 5 S3 lifecycle rules; Glue catalog, crawler, and two ETL jobs; SageMaker Feature Group. Features come only from purchases on or before T = 2026-04-01; churn_label comes only from (T, 2026-06-30]. The NAT gateway bills ~$0.045/hr: run scripts/teardown-lab2.sh after submitting.&lt;/i&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="390" width="1040" x="1200" y="1260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
